  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Life-giving water and strengthened livelihoods for vulnerable households in Monaragala, Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Needs Humanitarian Aid Trust alongside International Needs Lanka support farming households in 3 of the poorest villages in Monaragala, to have sustained wellbeing (physical and economic) through an integrated solution in the areas of&#xA0;drinking/agricultural water sufficiency, agricultural practice and livelihood diversification.</narrative>
  </description>
